{
  "_doc": "Tier-3 sheriff/ranger substation on Mill Street (Pell's Crossing, lot 'ranger', front faces the street). Route: through the gate into the fenced north lot (Hale's burned-out fire barrels) -> lobby doors barricaded from inside -> round the east side inside the fence to the smashed side-office door -> side office: Hale's log and the evidence key -> east hall -> cell block (sleepers in the corridor and in all three cells; Hale is the keener in cell 3) -> west hall -> unlock the evidence room (weapons locker, revolver, the cold box with the Bloom sample) -> unbolt the back door and leave outside the fence. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
